    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area : 104 sqm\nFlynn Estate Agents are absolutely delighted to present 18 Luttrellstown Place, Castleknock to the open market. This deceptively spacious 3 bedroom semi-detached home comes to the market in exellent condition throughout.The property itself has been fitted out to the highest standard offering contemporary design and modern conveniences. This home is designed around creating bright spacious living, while creating a warm welcoming atmosphere for the new owners. \n\nThe accommodation comprises of a spacious entrance hallway, living room, dining room and a fully fitted kitchen. Upstairs consists of three well proportioned bedrooms with the main benefiting from an ensuite. A main family bathroom completes the first floor accommodation. \n\nIts location is second to none with a small green very close by, makes it ideal for young children to safely play. Proximity to schools and shops including St. Patrick s National School & Castleknock Community School ensure the ultimate convenient location to set up home. Coolmine Train Station is less than a 15 minute walk and Dublin bus route no.37 is just minutes away. There is also easy access to the nearby Phoenix Park, Castleknock and Blanchardstown Villages, The M50 and Dublin airport. There are also several sports and golf clubs within walking distance.\n\nWe highly recommend viewing to fully appreciatate this fine family home!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.94m (6'4\") x 4.9m (16'1\")\nwith laminate wood flooring\n\nLounge - 3.97m (13'0\") x 4.98m (16'4\")\nwith laminate wood floor, feature fireplace with timber surround, double doors leading into the dining room\n\nDiningroom - 3.04m (10'0\") x 3.32m (10'11\")\nwith laminate wood flooring, double doors leading onto the rear garden\n\nKitchen - 2.85m (9'4\") x 4.57m (15'0\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan.\n\nGuest W.C. - 0.81m (2'8\") x 1.45m (4'9\")\nwith w.c & w.h.b., tiled flooring\n\nLanding - 2.02m (6'8\") x 2.27m (7'5\")\nwith carpet flooring, access to attic, hot press\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.07m (10'1\") x 4.07m (13'4\")\nto the rear of house with laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 2.84m (9'4\") x 1.6m (5'3\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., shower cubicle with pumped shower, tiled flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.07m (10'1\") x 4.23m (13'11\")\nto the front of house with laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.84m (9'4\") x 2.52m (8'3\")\nto the front of house with laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.84m (9'4\") x 1.64m (5'5\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with electric shower, vanity unit, tiled walls\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
