        "Content": "<ul><li> Double Glazed Windows </li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating </li><li> Well Presented Throughout </li><li> Close to schools and public transport </li><li> Quiet cul-de-sac </li><li> West facing rear garden </li><li> Chain Free Sale</li></ul>"
      },
